            <div xml:id="d911">

                <pb facs="0904" n="738" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg738"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 422.11G93/913</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Hartman to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Quito</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-02-17T17:00:00-05:14">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 17, 1917, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s February 13, 5 p.m. I presented note in person to the Minister for
                    Foreign Affairs this afternoon and fully complied with instructions.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hartman</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
